        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Conventionalized plant forms forming scroll border, green velvet on pale brown satin, the satin has been cut out and the velvet set in, cut edges concealed by silk tapes matching satin, backed with blue linen, two bands sewed together, fringe sewed to lower edge and on one side; condition poor."@en ;
